<title>GERMANY: Puma Q3 operating profit rises 10.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Puma Q3 operating profit rises 10.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   18.6    vs 16.9</p>
<p>Profit before tax and extraordinary</p>
<p>	    income				 18.1    vs 14.1</p>
<p>    Net sales				    139.4   vs 120.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sportswear group is Puma AG.</p>
</text>
